  "description": "GeoGround is a unified large vision-language model for remote sensing visual grounding, supporting horizontal bounding box (HBB), oriented bounding box (OBB), and segmentation mask outputs via a text-based approach. It introduces the Text-Mask paradigm and hybrid supervision, and is trained on the large-scale refGeo dataset.",
